**Format:**
Output a structured Markdown table that is downloadable as .md file. State findings directly with no introductory filler sentences before the table. Use the following exact columns:
*   Ticket Type (Bug, Improvement, New Feature)
*   Priority (P0, P1, P2)
*   Ticket Title (Clear and concise; or "NEEDS CLARIFICATION")
*   Actionable Description (What needs to be built or fixed)
